* @title Inspect a function's formals with ARG and LOCAL
* @expect >>>
* FORMAL ARGS: W H
* LOCAL VAR:   PROD
* AREA(4,5) =  20
* <<<
* ARG(f,n) and LOCAL(f,n) report the name of the n-th formal argument and n-th
* local variable of a defined function -- introspection used by debuggers and
* meta-programs. AREA is defined with formals W, H and one local PROD.
        DEFINE('AREA(W,H)PROD')       :(MAIN)
AREA    PROD = W * H
        AREA = PROD                   :(RETURN)
MAIN    OUTPUT = 'FORMAL ARGS: ' ARG('AREA',1) ' ' ARG('AREA',2)
        OUTPUT = 'LOCAL VAR:   ' LOCAL('AREA',1)
        OUTPUT = 'AREA(4,5) =  ' AREA(4,5)
END
